kcast (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Removed the C++ plugin entirely (KCastBridge) — KCast is now pure
    QML, all catt invocation goes through Plasma5Support's executable
    engine. No compiled .so anymore, installs cleanly via a plain
    kpackagetool6 -i/-u with no CMake build step required.
  * Added playlist support (search/shuffle/repeat, folder & M3U/M3U8
    import, drag-and-drop of multiple files).
  * Added a seek bar (-10s/+10s buttons, draggable position slider).

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:25:00 +0200

kcast (0.2.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed install(DIRECTORY package/...) shipping raw C++ source/CMakeLists
    as installed plasmoid data.
  * Fixed panel-icon scroll-to-change-volume, dead cursor styling, and a
    non-existent scanDevicesWithCatt() call in Settings' device search.
  * Fixed the bridge's mediaUrl going stale after a drag-and-drop or
    file-picker selection.
  * Now also builds and releases RPMs via OBS (previously .deb only).

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Thu, 09 Jul 2026 10:35:00 +0200

kcast (0.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial minimal Debian packaging for KF6/Qt6 (OBS builds for Debian/Ubuntu).

